		<bibliographic>
			<title>The Rice Exchange. Osaka. 18th Century</title>
			<author>Yuri Pavlenko (Goraph)</author>
			<language>en</language>
			<firstpublished>2025-05-03</firstpublished>
			<genre>Financial</genre>
			<group>URQ</group>
			<description>Japan, 18th Century. An old merchant lies dying in his home.<br/>He has three sons, and he calls them to his side: "The one among you who returns with the largest sum of money in 30 days will become my heir and receive all 10,000 yen from me as inheritance."<br/>Translated from Russian by Nikita Tseykovets.</description>
